In-Reply-To: <wkqz6_9SJ3w.8jZpTJleEwAJ@distance-sampling.groups.google.com>
References: <wkqz6_9SJ3w.8jZpTJleEwAJ@distance-sampling.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/distance-sampling/c/wkqz6_9SJ3w/m/RDpVg-lFDgAJ>
MIME-Version: 1.0
